-Subject: [PATCH] Mobile audit: POS sticky cart bar + fix bottom-nav overlap on
- every page
-
-Audited Dashboard, InvoiceEditor, and POS for leftover desktop-only
-layout. Dashboard and InvoiceEditor were already handled well
-(card-grid reflows to one column; InvoiceEditor already swaps its
-live document preview for a condensed mobile summary). POS had a
-real gap and a page-wide bug came up along the way:
-
-- POS: on a phone the cart sits below the entire product grid, so a
-  cashier had no way to see the running total or reach checkout
-  without scrolling past every product first. Added a sticky mobile
-  cart bar (item count + total + 'View Cart') that jumps down to the
-  real cart on tap, shown only while cart.length > 0.
-- Page-wide bug: .page never accounted for the fixed .bottom-nav bar's
-  height, so on every mobile page the last bit of content (e.g. a
-  save button) could sit underneath the tab bar. Added bottom padding
-  to .page sized to clear it, with safe-area-inset support for
-  notched phones.
